  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be point on the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, which is nearest to the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, then the distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> from the directrix of the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to:",
