  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given parabola is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Equation of normal is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>It passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, so</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>33</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>528</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>66</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now, we have parabola&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation of directrix&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, distance of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
